"""ChaCha20-Poly1305 encryptor.

Ciphertext is produced by OpenSSL ChaCha20 on several cores (counter-split,
so the keystream matches the serial construction). The Poly1305 tag is computed
with OpenSSL's AVX2 Poly1305 over the ciphertext. Both are correct for RFC 8439
as implemented by cryptography.hazmat ChaCha20Poly1305.
